; columns.svg is a recording of this program, on a clock that moves by its
; sleeps, so it shows the times test/eio/deterministic.t checks. To record
; it again, from the root of the repository:
;
;   dune build examples/columns/main.exe
;   k7 run --cols 100 --env CONSOLE_DETERMINISTIC_CLOCK=1 \
;     -o examples/columns/columns.svg -- _build/default/examples/columns/main.exe
